sequenceDiagram
  autonumber

  participant Client as Client
  participant Nginx as Nginx(:80)
  participant GW as API Gateway(:8080)
  participant Auth as Auth Service(:8081)
  participant Core as Core Service(:8082)
  participant DB as MySQL
  participant Redis as Redis
  participant Kafka as Kafka

  Note over Client,Auth: 1) 로그인(토큰 발급)
  Client->>Nginx: POST /api/auth/login
  Nginx->>GW: POST /api/auth/login
  GW->>Auth: POST /auth/login (StripPrefix=1)
  Auth->>DB: users 조회/검증
  Auth->>Redis: Refresh Token 저장(선택)
  Auth-->>GW: 200 + Access/Refresh Token
  GW-->>Client: 200 + Token

  Note over Client,Core: 2) 인증된 API 호출(헤더 주입)
  Client->>Nginx: GET /api/medications/
  Nginx->>GW: GET /api/medications/ (Authorization: Bearer ...)
  GW->>GW: JWT 검증 + X-User-* 주입
  GW->>Core: GET /medications/ (StripPrefix=1)
  Core->>DB: medications 조회(user_id 기준)
  Core-->>GW: 200 OK
  GW-->>Client: 200 OK

  Note over Client,Core: 3) SSE 구독(Notifications)
  Client->>Nginx: GET /api/notifications/subscribe?token=...
  Nginx->>GW: GET /api/notifications/subscribe?token=...
  GW->>GW: token(query)로 JWT 검증 + X-User-* 주입
  GW->>Core: GET /notifications/subscribe
  Core-->>Client: text/event-stream (연결 유지)

  Note over Client,Kafka: 4) 이벤트 기반(예: 채팅/알림)
  Core->>Kafka: Publish domain event
  Kafka-->>Core: Consume(필요 시)
